            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.33+NUM.21.34+NUM.21.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Guh 21:33-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Turaheza turakebanuka, tujana inzira idūga i Bashani; maze Ogi umwami waho aza kudutega bo n’ingabo ziwe zose, turumanira ahitwa Edireyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uhoraho arambarira, ati Ntimumutinye, kuko mmugabuye mu maboko yanyu, bo n’abantu biwe bose n’igihugu ciwe; namwe muze mumugirire nk’ivyo mwagiriye Sihoni umwami w’Abamori yaba i Heshiboni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuk’ Uhoraho Imana yacu arongera agabura na Ogi umwami w’i Bashani na we mu maboko yacu, bo n’ingabo ziwe zose; turamwica, ntitwasiga n’ uwa kirazira mu bantu biwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.4.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 4:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duca tunesha ibisagara vyiwe vyose, nta gisagara cabo na kimwe tutanesheje mu bisagara vyose ukw ari mirongwitandatu mu ntāra yose yo muri Arugobu i Bashani, mu gihugu ca Ogi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ivyo bisagara vyose vyari bikīkūjwe n’inzitiro ndende z’amabuye zirikw inzugi zugarijwe ibihindizo; hāri n’ibindi bisagara vyinshi cane bitāgira inzitiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.2.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gus 2:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.2.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Turabigeseza rwose, nk’uko twāgize kwa Sihoni umwami w’i Heshiboni, tugeseza igisagara cose, uhereye ku bagabo n’abagore n’ abana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arikw amasho yose ni yo twānyaze, bo n’ivyo twasahuye mur’ ivyo bisagara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
