              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi mbaha n’ikiyaya Araba, urubibe rugarukira kuri Yorodani, uhereye i Kinereti, ugashitsa ku kiyaga co mur’ ico kiyaya Araba, ari co Kiyaga c’Umunyu, kiri musi y’ agahanamo ka Pisiga ahahera i burasirazuba.",
          "type": "text",
